#### a_terminal_block_shows_the_command_and_its_output (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n\nrender_block (Terminal (\"hyperfine 'spiral build'\", \"Time (mean): 1.2 s\"))\n|> _assert_eq (\n       \"<pre class=\\\"terminal\\\"><code><span class=\\\"prompt\\\">$ </span>hyperfine 'spiral build'\\n\"\n       ^^ \"Time (mean): 1.2 s</code></pre>\"\n   )","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test

  render_block (Terminal ("hyperfine 'spiral build'", "Time (mean): 1.2 s"))
  |> _assert_eq (
         "<pre class=\"terminal\"><code><span class=\"prompt\">$ </span>hyperfine 'spiral build'\n"
         ^^ "Time (mean): 1.2 s</code></pre>"
     )
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### a_table_has_a_head_and_escaped_cells (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n\nrender_block (Table (Cons (\"Backend\", Cons (\"Rows\", Nil)), Cons (Cons (\"C\", Cons (\"< 500\", Nil)), Nil)))\n|> _assert_eq (\n       \"<table><thead><tr><th>Backend</th><th>Rows</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>C</td><td>&lt; \"\n       ^^ \"500</td></tr></tbody></table>\"\n   )","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test

  render_block (Table (Cons ("Backend", Cons ("Rows", Nil)), Cons (Cons ("C", Cons ("< 500", Nil)), Nil)))
  |> _assert_eq (
         "<table><thead><tr><th>Backend</th><th>Rows</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>C</td><td>&lt; "
         ^^ "500</td></tr></tbody></table>"
     )
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

